				<p>Grace Hennessey is a current senior at Agoura and has been layout designer for the Charger Post since her sophomore year. She is interested in a variety of STEM-related topics and loves to write. Besides academics, she participates in a variety of Varsity sports teams and is passionate about improving the student community at Agoura. In her spare time, she plays the piano and the viola, and loves crocheting, knitting, and embroidering.</p>
